OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman, 24, stabbed to death in
OL,5,CLevenshulme
OL,7,FA murder investigation's been launched
OL,8,Fafter a man was stabbed to death in
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FThe 24-year-old died at the scene.
OL,13,FPolice say a 27-year-old man has been
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of murder and is
OL,15,Fin custody.
OL,17,FOfficers were called to reports that a
OL,18,Fman had suffered serious stab wounds
OL,19,Fon Chapel Street, Levenshulme, on the
OL,20,Fevening of Saturday August 15.
