OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman, 24, stabbed to death in
OL,5,CLevenshulme
OL,7,FA spokesman said: "Several scenes
OL,8,Fremain in place whilst the
OL,9,Finvestigation continues.
OL,11,F"Work is ongoing to locate the
OL,12,Fvictim's next of kin.
OL,14,F"It is believed this was an isolated
OL,15,Fincident with no wider threat to the
OL,16,Fpublic."
OL,18,FThey are appealing for anyone with
OL,19,Finformation to come forward.
